#: src/ui/main.qml:57
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Graphics processors"
msgstr "图形处理器"

#: src/ui/main.qml:63
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "No graphics processor was found."
msgstr "未找到图形处理器。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:65
msgctxt "@info %1 is a number"
msgid "This computer has %1 graphics processor."
msgid_plural "This computer has %1 graphics processors."
msgstr[0] "此计算机有 %1 个图形处理器。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:66
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "This computer has one graphics processor. Every program draws on it."
msgstr "此计算机有一个图形处理器。所有程序都在它上面绘制。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:95
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Draws the desktop"
msgstr "绘制桌面"

#: src/ui/main.qml:97
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Draws the desktop after the next login"
msgstr "下次登录后绘制桌面"

#: src/ui/main.qml:98
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Draws this session until the next login"
msgstr "在下次登录前绘制本次会话"

#: src/ui/main.qml:126
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Your account may not use this GPU. Add it to the render group to send "
"programs here."
msgstr "您的账户不能使用此 GPU。请将账户加入 render 组，以便把程序发送到这里。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:133
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This chip only shows a picture. It cannot draw 3D or decode video, so it is "
"never offered below."
msgstr "此芯片只负责显示画面，不能绘制 3D 或解码视频，因此下方不会提供它。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:143
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Display && Monitor…"
msgstr "显示和监控…"

#: src/ui/main.qml:148
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Power Management…"
msgstr "电源管理…"

#: src/ui/main.qml:159
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Main desktop GPU"
msgstr "桌面主 GPU"

#: src/ui/main.qml:164
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Draws the desktop:"
msgstr "绘制桌面的 GPU："

#: src/ui/main.qml:182
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The desktop and every window are put together on this GPU. A change applies "
"at the next login."
msgstr "桌面和所有窗口都在此 GPU 上合成。更改将在下次登录时生效。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:183
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "There is only one GPU to draw the desktop on."
msgstr "只有一个 GPU 可用于绘制桌面。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:191
msgctxt "@info %1 is a GPU name"
msgid "This session still draws on %1 until you log in again."
msgstr "在您重新登录之前，此会话仍在 %1 上绘制。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:192
msgctxt "@info %1 is a GPU name"
msgid "This session draws on %1."
msgstr "此会话在 %1 上绘制。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:198
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"A KWIN_DRM_DEVICES line in your own folder ~/.config/plasma-workspace/env is "
"used instead of this choice."
msgstr ""
"您自己的文件夹 ~/.config/plasma-workspace/env 中的 KWIN_DRM_DEVICES 行将代替"
"此选择生效。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:209
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Where programs draw"
msgstr "程序在哪里绘制"

#: src/ui/main.qml:264
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Players follow their choice from the next time they start. For a game in "
"Steam, set its launch options to: sparky-stereo-gpu-run --category games "
"%command%, and add --3d for a game you play in 3D. For any single program, "
"use the list below."
msgstr ""
"播放器从下次启动起遵循此选择。对于 Steam 中的游戏，请将其启动选项设置为："
"sparky-stereo-gpu-run --category games %command%，以 3D 游玩的游戏请加上 "
"--3d。对于单个程序，请使用下面的列表。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:275
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Programs"
msgstr "程序"

#: src/ui/main.qml:282
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This is the same setting as Run Using Dedicated Graphics in the application "
"menu. The dedicated GPU is the discrete GPU; when the GPU the computer "
"starts with is already discrete, the program stays on it. A change applies "
"the next time the program starts."
msgstr ""
"这与应用程序菜单中的“使用独立显卡运行”是同一项设置。独立 GPU 即独立显卡；如果"
"计算机启动时使用的 GPU 已经是独立显卡，程序就留在它上面。更改将在程序下次启动"
"时生效。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:316
msgctxt "@info %1 is a GPU name"
msgid "Now: %1. The program asks for this itself."
msgstr "当前：%1。该程序自己提出了此要求。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:317
msgctxt "@info %1 is a GPU name"
msgid "Now: %1"
msgstr "当前：%1"

#: src/ui/main.qml:338
msgctxt "@info %1 is a number"
msgid "%1 more program is not shown. Type part of its name to find it."
msgid_plural ""
"%1 more programs are not shown. Type part of their name to find them."
msgstr[0] "还有 %1 个程序未显示。输入名称的一部分即可找到。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:347
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Video decoding"
msgstr "视频解码"

#: src/ui/main.qml:351
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Copy decoded video back"
msgstr "将解码的视频复制回来"

#: src/ui/main.qml:359
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Some players can use the GPU's video decoder only by copying every decoded "
"picture back to the processor. On some computers that drops more frames than "
"decoding in software. Players that show the decoded pictures where they are "
"do not need it, and a decoder you choose in a player is always used."
msgstr ""
"有些播放器只有把每一帧解码后的画面复制回处理器，才能使用 GPU 的视频解码器。在"
"某些计算机上，这比软件解码丢帧更多。直接在原处显示解码画面的播放器不需要它，"
"而您在播放器中选择的解码器始终会被使用。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:371
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"MEDIA_GPU_ROUTE_COPY_BACK is set in this session and is used instead of this "
"choice."
msgstr "此会话中设置了 MEDIA_GPU_ROUTE_COPY_BACK，将代替此选择使用。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:382
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "GPU power"
msgstr "GPU 电源"

#: src/ui/main.qml:389
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"These save power when the power profile asks for it. They work for the "
"graphics chip in this computer, with one GPU or several."
msgstr ""
"当电源配置要求时，这些选项可以省电。它们适用于此计算机的图形芯片，无论有一个"
"还是多个 GPU。"

#: src/cli/gpuenv.cpp:81
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "GPUs that can draw now:"
msgstr "现在可以绘制的 GPU："

#: src/cli/gpuenv.cpp:86
msgctxt "@info ID and COMMAND stay as they are"
msgid ""
"To start a program on one of them this time: sparky-stereo-gpu-run --choice "
"ID COMMAND"
msgstr ""
"要这一次在其中一个上启动程序：sparky-stereo-gpu-run --choice ID COMMAND"

#: src/cli/gpuenv.cpp:105
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Start"
msgstr "启动"

#: src/cli/gpuenv.cpp:107
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Do not start"
msgstr "不启动"

#: src/cli/gpuenv.cpp:109
