msgid "Integrated GPU"
msgstr "集成 GPU"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:396
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "Discrete GPU"
msgstr "独立 GPU"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:424
msgctxt "@info %1 is a GPU name, %2 the reason"
msgid "Started in 3D: %1, %2"
msgstr "以 3D 启动时：%1，%2"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:428
msgctxt "@info %1 is a GPU name, %2 the reason"
msgid "Now: %1, %2"
msgstr "当前：%1，%2"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:462
msgctxt "@info %1 says why"
msgid "The power profile could not be read: %1."
msgstr "无法读取电源配置：%1。"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:466
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Power profile: Power Saver. Automatic draws browsers on the integrated GPU. "
"Other programs stay on the GPU that draws the desktop."
msgstr ""
"电源配置：节能。“自动”在集成 GPU 上绘制浏览器。其他程序留在绘制桌面的 GPU "
"上。"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:468
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Power profile: Performance. Automatic draws browsers on the discrete GPU. "
"Other programs stay on the GPU that draws the desktop."
msgstr ""
"电源配置：性能。“自动”在独立 GPU 上绘制浏览器。其他程序留在绘制桌面的 GPU "
"上。"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:472
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Power profile: Balanced. Automatic draws browsers on the GPU that draws the "
"desktop. Other programs stay there too."
msgstr ""
"电源配置：平衡。“自动”在绘制桌面的 GPU 上绘制浏览器。其他程序也留在那里。"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:485
msgctxt "@info %1 is a GPU name, %2 a PCI address or vendor and device ids"
msgid ""
"Automatic draws players, games and any program started in 3D on %1 whatever "
"the power profile, on battery too. The GPU this computer was measured best "
"on, %2, is not here now, so that is its discrete GPU."
msgstr ""
"“自动”在 %1 上绘制播放器、游戏以及任何以 3D 启动的程序，无论电源配置如何，使"
"用电池时也是如此。为此计算机测得的最佳 GPU %2 现在不在，因此这是它的独立 "
"GPU。"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:492
msgctxt "@info %1 is a GPU name"
msgid ""
"Automatic draws players, games and any program started in 3D on %1 whatever "
"the power profile, on battery too. This computer has not been measured yet, "
"so that is its discrete GPU."
msgstr ""
"“自动”在 %1 上绘制播放器、游戏以及任何以 3D 启动的程序，无论电源配置如何，使"
"用电池时也是如此。此计算机尚未测量，因此这是它的独立 GPU。"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:498
msgctxt "@info %1 is a GPU name, %2 a computer model"
msgid ""
"Automatic draws players, games and any program started in 3D on %1 whatever "
"the power profile, on battery too: it was measured best for them on the %2."
msgstr ""
"“自动”在 %1 上绘制播放器、游戏以及任何以 3D 启动的程序，无论电源配置如何，使"
"用电池时也是如此：在 %2 上测得它对它们最佳。"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:504
msgctxt "@info %1 is a GPU name"
msgid ""
"Automatic draws players, games and any program started in 3D on %1 whatever "
"the power profile, on battery too: it was measured best for them on this "
"computer."
msgstr ""
"“自动”在 %1 上绘制播放器、游戏以及任何以 3D 启动的程序，无论电源配置如何，使"
"用电池时也是如此：在此计算机上测得它对它们最佳。"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:529
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This computer has not been measured for it, so it is Off unless you turn it "
"on."
msgstr "此计算机未就此测量，因此除非您打开，否则为关闭。"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:531
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "This computer's measured setting: On."
msgstr "此计算机测得的设置：开。"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:531
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "This computer's measured setting: Off."
msgstr "此计算机测得的设置：关。"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:578
msgctxt "@info in place of a GPU name"
msgid "its group's GPU cannot be used"
msgstr "其所在组的 GPU 无法使用"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:600
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "Same as its group"
msgstr "与所属分组相同"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:601
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "The dedicated GPU"
msgstr "独立 GPU"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:602
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "The main GPU"
msgstr "主 GPU"

#: src/problems.cpp:86
msgctxt "@info why the power profile could not be read"
msgid "the system bus cannot be reached"
msgstr "无法连接系统总线"

#: src/problems.cpp:89
msgctxt "@info why the power profile could not be read"
msgid "power-profiles-daemon did not answer"
msgstr "power-profiles-daemon 没有响应"

#: src/problems.cpp:90
msgctxt "@info why the power profile could not be read, %1 is the error"
msgid "power-profiles-daemon did not answer (%1)"
msgstr "power-profiles-daemon 没有响应（%1）"

#: src/problems.cpp:94
msgctxt "@info why the power profile could not be read, %1 is a profile name"
msgid "power-profiles-daemon named a profile this page does not know, %1"
msgstr "power-profiles-daemon 给出了此页面不认识的配置 %1"

#: src/problems.cpp:98
msgctxt "@info why the power profile could not be read, %1 is a value"
msgid "SPARKY_STEREO_POWER_PROFILE is %1, which is not a power profile"
msgstr "SPARKY_STEREO_POWER_PROFILE 为 %1，这不是电源配置"

#: src/problems.cpp:100
msgctxt "@info why the power profile could not be read"
msgid "power-profiles-daemon is not running"
msgstr "power-profiles-daemon 未运行"

#: src/problems.cpp:221
msgctxt "@item kind of program inside a sentence: The GPU you chose for %1"
msgid "players"
msgstr "播放器"

#: src/problems.cpp:224
msgctxt "@item kind of program inside a sentence: The GPU you chose for %1"
msgid "games"
msgstr "游戏"

#: src/problems.cpp:227
msgctxt "@item kind of program inside a sentence: The GPU you chose for %1"
msgid "browsers"
msgstr "浏览器"

#: src/problems.cpp:229
msgctxt "@item kind of program inside a sentence: The GPU you chose for %1"
msgid "other programs"
msgstr "其他程序"

#: src/problems.cpp:235
msgctxt "@title notification"
msgid "A graphics choice cannot be used"
msgstr "无法使用一项图形选择"

#: src/problems.cpp:237
msgctxt "@title notification"
msgid "Graphics needs a repair"
msgstr "图形需要修复"

#: src/problems.cpp:251
msgctxt "@info %1 is a PCI address"
msgid ""
"The GPU you chose to draw the desktop, at PCI address %1, is not in this "
"computer now."
msgstr "您选择用来绘制桌面的 GPU（PCI 地址 %1）现在不在此计算机中。"

#: src/problems.cpp:252
msgctxt "@info %1 is a kind of program, %2 a PCI address"
msgid ""
"The GPU you chose for %1, at PCI address %2, is not in this computer now."
msgstr "您为%1选择的 GPU（PCI 地址 %2）现在不在此计算机中。"

#: src/problems.cpp:253
msgctxt "@info what to do"
msgid "Put the GPU back, or choose another GPU in System Settings, Graphics."
msgstr "请把该 GPU 装回去，或在“系统设置 > 图形”中选择另一个 GPU。"

#: src/problems.cpp:257
msgctxt "@info %1 is a PCI address"
msgid ""
"The GPU you chose to draw the desktop, at PCI address %1, is in this "
"computer, but no graphics driver is loaded for it."
msgstr ""
"您选择用来绘制桌面的 GPU（PCI 地址 %1）在此计算机中，但没有为它加载图形驱动程"
"序。"

#: src/problems.cpp:260
msgctxt "@info %1 is a kind of program, %2 a PCI address"
msgid ""
"The GPU you chose for %1, at PCI address %2, is in this computer, but no "
"graphics driver is loaded for it."
msgstr ""
"您为%1选择的 GPU（PCI 地址 %2）在此计算机中，但没有为它加载图形驱动程序。"

#: src/problems.cpp:265
msgctxt "@info %1 is a PCI address, %2 a kernel driver"
msgid ""
"The GPU you chose to draw the desktop, at PCI address %1, is in this "
"computer, but its driver, %2, gives it no graphics device."
msgstr ""
"您选择用来绘制桌面的 GPU（PCI 地址 %1）在此计算机中，但它的驱动程序 %2 没有为"
"它提供图形设备。"

#: src/problems.cpp:269
msgctxt "@info %1 is a kind of program, %2 a PCI address, %3 a kernel driver"
msgid ""
"The GPU you chose for %1, at PCI address %2, is in this computer, but its "
"driver, %3, gives it no graphics device."
msgstr ""
"您为%1选择的 GPU（PCI 地址 %2）在此计算机中，但它的驱动程序 %3 没有为它提供图"
"形设备。"

#: src/problems.cpp:274
msgctxt "@info what to do"
msgid ""
"Install or repair its driver, or choose another GPU in System Settings, "
"Graphics."
msgstr "请安装或修复它的驱动程序，或在“系统设置 > 图形”中选择另一个 GPU。"

#: src/problems.cpp:276
msgctxt "@info why a GPU cannot draw, %1 is a kernel driver"
msgid "its driver, %1, gives it no render node"
msgstr "它的驱动程序 %1 没有为它提供渲染节点"

#: src/problems.cpp:277
msgctxt "@info %1 is a GPU name, %2 says why"
msgid "The GPU you chose to draw the desktop, %1, cannot draw now: %2."
msgstr "您选择用来绘制桌面的 GPU %1 现在无法绘制：%2。"

#: src/problems.cpp:278
msgctxt "@info %1 is a kind of program, %2 a GPU name, %3 says why"
msgid "The GPU you chose for %1, %2, cannot draw now: %3."
msgstr "您为%1选择的 GPU %2 现在无法绘制：%3。"

#: src/problems.cpp:279
msgctxt "@info what to do"
msgid "Choose a GPU that can draw in System Settings, Graphics."
msgstr "请在“系统设置 > 图形”中选择一个可以绘制的 GPU。"

#: src/problems.cpp:282
msgctxt "@info %1 is a kind of program, %2 a GPU name, %3 a device file"
msgid ""
"The GPU you chose for %1, %2, cannot be used by your account: %3 cannot be "
"opened."
msgstr "您为%1选择的 GPU %2 无法由您的账户使用：无法打开 %3。"

#: src/problems.cpp:287
msgctxt "@info what to do"
msgid ""
"Add your account to the render group (sudo adduser $USER render) and log in "
"again, or choose another GPU in System Settings, Graphics."
msgstr ""
"请将您的账户加入 render 组（sudo adduser $USER render）并重新登录，或在“系统"
"设置 > 图形”中选择另一个 GPU。"

#: src/problems.cpp:290
msgctxt "@info %1 is a kind of program"
msgid ""
"You chose the integrated GPU for %1, and this computer has none that can "
"draw now."
msgstr "您为%1选择了集成 GPU，但此计算机现在没有可以绘制的集成 GPU。"

#: src/problems.cpp:291
msgctxt "@info %1 is a kind of program"
msgid ""
"You chose the discrete GPU for %1, and this computer has none that can draw "
"now."
msgstr "您为%1选择了独立 GPU，但此计算机现在没有可以绘制的独立 GPU。"

#: src/problems.cpp:292
msgctxt "@info what to do"
msgid "Choose another GPU in System Settings, Graphics."
msgstr "请在“系统设置 > 图形”中选择另一个 GPU。"

#: src/problems.cpp:295
msgctxt "@info %1 is a kind of program, %2 says why"
msgid ""
"The GPU for %1 follows the power profile, and the power profile could not be "
"read: %2."
msgstr "%1使用的 GPU 跟随电源配置，但无法读取电源配置：%2。"

#: src/problems.cpp:298
msgctxt "@info what to do"
msgid ""
"Start power-profiles-daemon (sudo systemctl start power-profiles-daemon), or "
"choose a GPU in System Settings, Graphics."
msgstr ""
"请启动 power-profiles-daemon（sudo systemctl start power-profiles-daemon），"
"或在“系统设置 > 图形”中选择一个 GPU。"

#: src/problems.cpp:301
msgctxt "@info %1 is a file"
msgid ""
"The machine's GPU record, %1, could not be written. Until it is, Automatic "
"treats this computer as not measured. Run: sudo sparky-stereo-gpu-record --"
"apply-known"
msgstr ""
"无法写入本机的 GPU 记录 %1。在写入之前，“自动”会把此计算机视为未测量。请运"
"行：sudo sparky-stereo-gpu-record --apply-known"

#: src/problems.cpp:306
msgctxt "@info %1 is an exit status"
msgid ""
"systemd could not reload its units after the Graphics page was installed "
"(exit status %1). The boot service that writes the machine's GPU record may "
"not start. Run: sudo systemctl daemon-reload"
msgstr ""
"安装“图形”页面后，systemd 无法重新加载其单元（退出状态 %1）。写入本机 GPU 记"
"录的启动服务可能无法启动。请运行：sudo systemctl daemon-reload"

#: src/problems.cpp:310
msgctxt "@info %1 is a file"
msgid "A kept problem of the Graphics page cannot be read: %1."
msgstr "无法读取“图形”页面保存的问题：%1。"

#: src/problems.cpp:313
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "At this login the desktop draws on the GPU the system picks."
msgstr "本次登录时，桌面由系统选定的 GPU 绘制。"
